description:
The Icare IC333 Electric Homecare Bed is unmatched for function and durability, taking the hospital look out of your room.

This four function bed features dual lift motors totaling 12,000 newtons lifting power, unlimited under-bed clearance and eight heavy duty castors. Designed to improve your sleep and independence, and tailored to suit your room.

Features

200kg Safe Working Load on Long Single and King Single
300kg Safe Working Load on Double and Queen
Electric Hi-Lo, Head Raise, Knee Break and Trendelenburg
Strong breathable mattress platform
End and side mattress retainer bars
Available with headboards
External rechargeable battery backup
Lockable heavy duty castors
Back lit wipeable hand piece
Unlimited under bed clearance
Reducing risk of falls
Ultra low design
No gap between mattresses on King Beds (2 x Long Singles)
10 year limited warranty

