Looking for an upgrade? Check out the beautiful IC777

Upgrade your bedrooms beauty and functionality with Icare's Australian-made four function bed!
The Icare I777 Premium Homecare Bed features dual lift motors with 12,000 newtons lifting power and unlimited under-bed clearance. Additionally, the included cordless remote with preset functions, including a flashlight, is easy to use and backlit when activated. The bed comes in a variety of beautiful hard-wearing, antibacterial treated vinyls and commercial-grade fabrics. As well as this, the strong metal mesh platform ensures increased airflow, while the no-pull motors and lockable heavy-duty castors guarantee added safety and convenience. Lastly, with a long-lasting rechargeable battery backup and wipeable remote, this bed is the perfect combination of beauty and functionality.

Features

200kg Safe Working Load on Long Single and King Single
300kg Safe Working Load on Double and Queen
Electric Hi-Lo, Head Raise, Knee Break and Trendelenburg
Long-life rechargeable battery back up, lasting 2-5 days of usual use
Easy press button remote, backlit when activated for use. Wipeable
Cordless remote with flashlight, and preset functions
Hard wearing commercial grade fabric. Vinyl is treated with antibacterial properties
Strong metal mesh mattress platform allowing increased airflow
No pull motors for added safety
Three Designs to choose from: Amsterdam, Cologne or Karlstead

Available in:

Long Single - 2030 x 900mm
King Single - 2030 x 1070mm
Long Double - 2030 x 1350mm
Queen - 2030 x 1520mm

